The innermost ISO 7 Cleanroom Suite 115B, and the ISO 5 BSC E001314 within the Suite 115B were thoroughly cleaned and prepared before initiating the 
testing as per SOP 2.600.002 (Environmental Monitoring of the Clean Room Facility), and SOP 2.600.018 (Cleaning and Disinfecting Procedure for Microbiology
). Furthermore, the BSC used throughout testing, E001314, was certified and approved by both the Engineering and Quality Assurance teams.
